      "id": "evidence-adv-text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 515,
      "width": 1160,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#22c55e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "seed": 2044,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2044,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": [],
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Photo Upload: POST /media -> S3 raw -> worker generates [thumbnail_150px, medium_612px, full_1080px] -> all variants in S3 -> metadata in Posts DB\n\nFeed Read: GET /feed?userId=123 -> Redis cache hit (pre-computed ranked list) -> hydrate post data -> CDN URLs for all image variants\n\nStory Expiry: ZADD stories:userId {score=expiry_timestamp, member=storyId} | ZREMRANGEBYSCORE stories:userId 0 NOW (cron every minute)\n\nPush: Kafka event {type:like, postId, likerId} -> NotifSvc -> APNS (iOS) + FCM (Android) fan-out",
      "originalText": "Photo Upload: POST /media -> S3 raw -> worker generates [thumbnail_150px, medium_612px, full_1080px] -> all variants in S3 -> metadata in Posts DB\n\nFeed Read: GET /feed?userId=123 -> Redis cache hit (pre-computed ranked list) -> hydrate post data -> CDN URLs for all image variants\n\nStory Expiry: ZADD stories:userId {score=expiry_timestamp, member=storyId} | ZREMRANGEBYSCORE stories:userId 0 NOW (cron every minute)\n\nPush: Kafka event {type:like, postId, likerId} -> NotifSvc -> APNS (iOS) + FCM (Android) fan-out",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "evidence-adv",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
